<title>POLAND: Stalexport signs $4.4 mln export deal.</title>
<headline>Stalexport signs $4.4 mln export deal.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's steel trader Stalexport SA said on Thursday it had signed a $4.4 million contract to export steel to Taiwan.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that under the contract the steel had to be delivered by the end of May.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
